            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yeah, you're right.\n\n> semver convention `v<major>.<minor>.<patch>` (with or without `v` prefix).\n> Like `v1.2.0` or `1.2.0`, but not `1.2` or `v1`.\n\nSorry about the inconvenience. Will close the issue as it is not one. Thanks for the fast replies.",
