        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> `2.17` is not a valid semver. however i think there's a way to workaround it by specifying `version` explicitly? [@echasnovski](https://github.com/echasnovski)\n\nYes, `version = 'v2.17'` would work as it fixes to the explicit tag.\n\nAnd yes, it is indeed expected and documented because `v2.17` is *technically* not a semver tag.\n\nFor the motivation and overall reasoning, see #39214.",
